        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Circa 1.82 acre Development Site with full Planning Permission for a circa  628 Sq., Metre Industrial Unit at Ballindine Road, Claremorris, Co. Mayo. \r\nThis site is located in a prime location, with easy access to the N17, & excellent passing trade. These lands are zoned for Enterprise & Employment and are in a recognized commercial area. \r\n\r\nPlans include:\r\n\r\nGround Floor - Entrance Hallway, Showroom Lobby, Administration Area, 2 x Private Offices, WC.,\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: - Mezzanine  - Canteen, Office & Storage.\r\n\r\nFull particulars from Selling Agents."
      },
      {
