        "Content": "Circa 1.82 Acre Development Site.\r\nFull Planning Permission for a circa 628 Sq. Metre Industrial Unit.\r\nIn a prime location with easy access to the N17.\r\nThis is a recognised commercial area.\r\nExcellent passing trade.\r\nLands zoned for Enterprise and Employment."
